    LLM: 'Play legally; try to domino before the hand blocks.\n\nThere are seven tiles in the sixes suit; five are in the center when the spinner is complete. Watch which arms opponents avoid to infer missing suits.\n\nUse the fact that when one of the two remaining sixes is played on an arm, that arm is blocked to all but the other six. Use opponent arm choices to read their hands.',
